Github Digital-Signal-Processing-in-Geophysics Update
-----------------------------------------------------

How to get the latest version of Digital-Signal-Processing-in-Geophysics from the Github repository
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Clone ...

... the main branch

git clone git@github.com:daniel-koehn/Digital-Signal-Processing-in-Geophysics.git

... only the latest main branch update 

git clone --depth=1 git@github.com:daniel-koehn/Digital-Signal-Processing-in-Geophysics.git

... a developing branch

git clone -b branch_name git@github.com:daniel-koehn/Digital-Signal-Processing-in-Geophysics.git

Update of Github Digital-Signal-Processing-in-Geophysics repository
-------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Move to Digital-Signal-Processing-in-Geophysics directory
2. git add -A
3. git commit -m "Comment on the latest update"

For a specific branch ...
4. git push origin branch_name

For main branch ...
4. git push origin main
